/target

# Staged copy of the web app, written by build.rs before each compile.
/web

# Capability schemas, regenerated by tauri-build on every compile.
#
# gen/android is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the Android Studio project,
# and tracking it is what lets the app be opened and built from Android Studio.
# Its own .gitignore drops the Gradle build output and the .so that build.rs
# symlinks in, so only the project sources are committed.
/gen/schemas

# Cargo.lock is intentionally NOT ignored: this is an application, and pinning
# dependencies is what makes the shipped binary reproducible.